{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/05646863feb6da49d5eda84ce5a07113.avif?t=1771301711\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras_big/05646863feb6da49d5eda84ce5a07113.avif?t=1771301711 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the year 20XX. You've failed your university entrance exams, and you're unemployed\u2014as usual, you live out your hikkikomori days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, as you're watching anime in your room, spending time with your waifus in your monitor\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mother, fed up, kicks you out (literally) to live in a sharehouse in Seoul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're given a mission: get your act together like your roommates, but when you arrive, you find... three gorgeous girls...!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energetic and bold - Jihye Ryu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mature... with an unexpected side - Yunha Park</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute but bites back coldly - Saeun Hong</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/28dc78280de46fb5b1ec44f83eda3721.avif?t=1771301711\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras_big/28dc78280de46fb5b1ec44f83eda3721.avif?t=1771301711 width=800 height=667 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/58991453d6bb7ad229256ada78d089c5.avif?t=1771301711\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras_big/58991453d6bb7ad229256ada78d089c5.avif?t=1771301711 width=800 height=667 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/25063a1f18e0220aab3587bf1fbceb66.avif?t=1771301711\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras_big/25063a1f18e0220aab3587bf1fbceb66.avif?t=1771301711 width=800 height=667 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Stories from our lives]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In 'Welcome, Sharehouse!', we take common struggles of young adults in our modern world and tell them in a comedic way. As we live with these three roommates, we try to figure out our futures together.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Gorgeous illustrations]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In order to fully capture what makes these characters charming, we've paid great attention to detail in each illustration. Enjoy the feeling of living with these cute girls!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Intuitively designed user interface]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To make playing the game as easy as possible, we've designed the interface with the user experience in mind so that you can focus on the exciting romance with your new roommates!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496340/extras/c9b34c34c6e7765dc449666260f5083d.avif?t=1771301711\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamsta